      "quality": "poor",
      "qualityReason": "vague"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Grasshopper infestations and the 1926‑1932 Dust Bowl caused widespread farm foreclosures, mirroring Callaway’s own struggles with unpayable mortgages.",
